.TH COVERAGE 1 "September 2026" "Kagi 0.38.0" "Developer Commands"
.SH NAME
coverage \- generate Kagi LLVM source coverage reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scripts/coverage
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs cargo-llvm-cov across workspace targets and writes LCOV and HTML reports under coverage/. Optional CUDA coverage can be enabled with KAGI_COVERAGE_ALL_FEATURES=1.
